.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_KDF-X942-CONCAT 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_KDF-X942-CONCAT
.Nd The X942 Concat EVP_KDF implementation
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The EVP_KDF-X942-CONCAT algorithm is identical to EVP_KDF-X963. It is
used for key agreement to derive a key using input such as a shared
secret key and shared info.
.Ss Identity
"X942KDF_CONCAT" is the name for this implementation; it can be used
with the
.Xr EVP_KDF_fetch 3
function.
.Pp
This is an alias for "X963KDF".
.Pp
See
.Xr EVP_KDF-X963 7
for a list of supported parameters and examples.
.Sh HISTORY
This functionality was added in OpenSSL 3.0.
